OL,3,GNEWSAWhat new railway station could
OL,4,Alook like
OL,5,
OL,6,FDetailed plans for a new railway
OL,7,Fstation have been revealed, with
OL,8,Fconstruction expected to begin early in
OL,9,Fthe new year.
OL,11,FNetwork Rail wants to build two
OL,12,Fplatforms and a footbridge in
OL,13,FWellington, Somerset, as well as
OL,14,Fseating, shelters and ticket machines.
OL,16,FA spokesperson said the company wanted
OL,17,Fthe project to "be a high-quality
OL,18,Fgateway to Wellington, robust enough
OL,19,Ffor an operational railway".
OL,23,APub: 21-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,349,340,200,160,0,100
