OL,3,GNEWSAWhat new railway station could
OL,4,Alook like
OL,5,
OL,6,FNetwork Rail said a formal planning
OL,7,Fapplication had been submitted to
OL,8,FSomerset Council and it hoped the
OL,9,Frailway station would open to the
OL,10,Fpublic by 2028.
